<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="chick-las" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Lasagna - Chicken (Jill Vanderstoep)</title>

  <p>
    Ingredients
  </p>
  <tabular>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> cup butter</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cloves garlic, chopped</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> cup flour</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
    <cell>1 teaspoon salt (optional)</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cups milk</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cups chicken broth</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cups mozzarella cheese</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 cup parmesan cheese</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>1 onion, chopped</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> teaspoon basil</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{2}</m> teaspoon oregano</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell><m>\frac{1}{4}</m> teaspoon pepper (optional)</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>8 ounces lasagna noodles, uncooked</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cups cottage cheese</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>2 cups chicken, cooked and cubed</cell>
    </row>
    <row>
      <cell>20 ounces chopped spinach</cell>
    </row>
  </tabular>

  <p>Instructions
    <ol>
      <li>
        <p>
          Melt butter in large pan and add garlic.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Stir in flour and salt. Add milk and broth and whisk to prevent lumps.  Heat until it boils, stirring constantly.  Boil for 1 minute.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Stir in mozzarella cheese and <m>\frac{1}{2}</m> cup parmesan cheese.  Add onion, basil, oregano, and pepper.  Stir constantly over low heat until cheese melts.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Spread <m>\frac{1}{4}</m> of the cheese sauce (from above) in a 9" x 13" ungreased pan.  Top with 3 uncooked noodles.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Spread half of the cottage cheese, <m>\frac{1}{4}</m> of the cheese sauce, and top with 3 uncooked noodles.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Spread the remaining cottage cheese; layer the chicken; put spinach over chicken; spread <m>\frac{1}{4}</m> of the cheese sauce.  Top with 3 uncooked noodles.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Spread remaining cheese sauce, and top with <m>\frac{1}{2}</m> cup parmesan cheese.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          Bake at <m>350^\circ</m> for 40 minutes until bubbly and starting to brown. Let stand for 10 to 15 minutes before serving.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </p>

  <p>
    Notes:
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          
        </p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
</section>